What: Spark Structured Streaming based incremental file ingestion — automatically detects and loads new files as they arrive
Autoloader designed specifically for ingesting files from cloud storage only - not tables or views 

df = spark.readStream.format("cloudFiles") \
  .option("cloudFiles.format", "json") \
  .load("abfss://container@storage/raw/orders/")

df.writeStream.format("delta") \
  .option("checkpointLocation", "/checkpoints/orders") \
  .toTable("bronze.orders")

Key Points:

Continuous streaming — detects new files automatically
Scales to billions of files efficiently
Checkpoint based — remembers where it stopped
Schema inference and evolution built in
Best for real time and large scale ingestion

