Correct Answer: No! INSERT OVERWRITE use చేయాలి! Full data వస్తే row level comparison waste. INSERT OVERWRITE is faster and simpler for full refresh!
Q2: "MERGE INTO లో source లో ఒక customer record రెండుసార్లు ఉంటే ఏం జరుగుతుంది?"
Correct Answer: Runtime error! MERGE fails if source has duplicate keys matching same target row. You must deduplicate source before MERGE — interviewers love this answer!
Q3: "INSERT OVERWRITE చేసిన తర్వాత పాత data తిరిగి చూడగలమా?"
Correct Answer: Yes! Using Delta Time Travel! INSERT OVERWRITE creates new version in transaction log — previous version still accessible via VERSION AS OF!
Q4: "CDC pipeline కి ఏది use చేస్తారు?"
Correct Answer: MERGE INTO — because CDC has inserts, updates AND deletes coming from source. MERGE handles all three in single operation!
