Delta Live Tables (DLT) — Complete Guide 🎯
What is Delta Live Tables?
"Delta Live Tables is a declarative ETL framework in Databricks where you declare WHAT your pipeline should produce — Databricks automatically manages HOW to run it, monitor it, retry failures, handle data quality and optimize performance"
Simple Analogy 🍕
Traditional ETL (Without DLT):
Like cooking yourself:
→ You buy ingredients
→ You follow recipe steps
