Two Pipeline Modes
TRIGGERED Mode:
→ Run on schedule
→ Process new data
→ Stop after completion
→ Cost efficient ✅
→ Like trigger(availableNow=True)

CONTINUOUS Mode:
→ Always running
→ Process data as it arrives
→ Low latency
→ More expensive
→ Like continuous streaming


